      "id": "436edaf7-1541-4b39-a8f6-4a9926fc51fe",
      "name": "Prokaryote",
      "description": {
        "content": "#### Options to download prokaryote gene data, including the associated sequence and metadata.\nThese gene services allow you to download gene and protein sequence, and metadata as a prokaryote gene data package, for prokaryotic [RefSeq non-redundant proteins](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/refseq/about/nonredundantproteins/).\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
